      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialoguePenny",
      "key": "Outdoor_4",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Ahh... It feels great to be outside. I could spend all day right here, observing every little thing.",
      "translation": "Ach... Venku je nádherně. Klidně bych mohla strávit celý den právě tady a pozorovat každý detail.",
      "sourceSHA256": "b5b724b4b7ac39e6e1aca17e0d324195880557f290331de1157aee8dfa9954a5",
      "translationSHA256": "4ecf9e51b72a36d1a7b3bb8b6cee882c7f3258d31afdf2ea5103f1223461e26a",
