    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialoguePenny",
      "key": "OneKid_3",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I feel a lot older now that we have a child. Maybe it's just this new responsibility weighing on me.#$e#It's not bad! I've wanted this for a long time.$11",
      "translation": "Teď, když máme dítě, se cítím mnohem starší. Možná mě jen tíží nová odpovědnost.#$e#Není to nic špatného! Tohle jsem si už dlouho přála.$11",
      "sourceSHA256": "0cfbf7b4081a7bec291ca463eb4a6e6abd0ee08f240f08a665b30bdbf1cb7e00",
      "translationSHA256": "7825c5f9a43969cdf1b040318430c226e8f24238192add5cbfd3f36caba1b587",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialoguePenny",
      "key": "TwoKids_0",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I already gave %kid1 and %kid2 their food. They're such hungry children!",
      "translation": "O jídlo pro %kid1 a %kid2 už jsem se postarala. To jsou ale hladové děti!",
      "sourceSHA256": "96676db9ed3fd117d1bdcde2f671c7eb3a04bd70d62359877bc0f0d039ab1184",
      "translationSHA256": "177ee4eef8a085f5462503635919767991e4b2c98e44e8556e7adfdf0dacb585",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialoguePenny",
      "key": "TwoKids_1",
      "field": null,
      "source": "We have to make sure and give %kid1 a lot of attention now that we have %kid2. We don't want any jealousy between them.",
      "translation": "Teď, když máme %kid2, musíme dávat %kid1 dostatek pozornosti. Nechceme, aby mezi nimi vznikla žárlivost.",
      "sourceSHA256": "a4a1205484e08f549e2dcede2d57f32fad7de4cfe2c1c101bb290f96cf15e336",
      "translationSHA256": "35a43d9d2f6e8b010d4d1580bb36d6f1465e4fe7794e67d2df660d1350812ea4",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialoguePenny",
      "key": "TwoKids_2",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I've had this dream that %kid2 grew wings and flew into the night sky. What does it mean?",
      "translation": "Měla jsem sen, ve kterém %kid2 s křídly odlétá na noční oblohu. Co to znamená?",
      "sourceSHA256": "8a114b77f834e509aa0ee7ca4d9947ebbfdea101abd8c4693fca47d3ed852b99",
      "translationSHA256": "c6d9af341cfdecd7a687cdded5945b6416fb953c47507ded90b2adb463f7dcc0",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialoguePenny",
      "key": "TwoKids_3",
      "field": null,
      "source": "A nice house, two wonderful kids, and a beautiful plot of land. We're so very fortunate.",
      "translation": "Pěkný dům, dvě úžasné děti a krásný pozemek. Máme obrovské štěstí.",
      "sourceSHA256": "be761415b84009f2fd9897969a87a412c6bf3809f9bc6b46fc4ed7661afab8ba",
      "translationSHA256": "6718371ab7a48a4344a817d2a2d353f8598c33410e4dc988bdd88ac98885db9e",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
