    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialoguePenny",
      "key": "Good_3",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Wow, you look really handsome today! Did you shave?$l^Wow, you look beautiful today. Did you do something different with your hair?$l",
      "translation": "Páni, dnes vypadáš opravdu pohledně! Oholil ses?$l^Páni, dnes vypadáš nádherně. Udělala sis něco s vlasy?$l",
      "sourceSHA256": "b14808aad0d520ab85dd5e36dbddda4c2252b4c8ce5ebfbd35b7a4093bb907a4",
      "translationSHA256": "e45ea789a36399c014d4f3159d14c4128bd0d348278fbe52a8551ee912c16d76",
