    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialoguePenny",
      "key": "summer_2",
      "field": null,
      "source": "In summer, the ants become very active. I could watch them for hours... they have a pretty complex civilization from the looks of it!",
      "translation": "V létě jsou mravenci velmi aktivní. Mohla bych je celé hodiny pozorovat... Zdá se, že mají docela složitou civilizaci!",
      "sourceSHA256": "26277b61a22a488049e9561dc063fb56c0d10ddc51cab7ea850ea06d5cc08658",
      "translationSHA256": "d38dba2e02b9b844fe6c4928a9d9a3bda9a2a8586d1dc13ac55495e92ec84f43",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
