    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialoguePenny",
      "key": "fall_1",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Fall... It makes me think of colored paper and glue. Maybe I'm spending too much time with the children.$h",
      "translation": "Podzim... Připomíná mi barevný papír a lepidlo. Možná s dětmi trávím příliš mnoho času.$h",
      "sourceSHA256": "d91a35326fa1afea5baa68e8a89b2cd58d859752306a58fcbedbb207412087ea",
      "translationSHA256": "8ece3507e42b1bac0d00b5e301c9ad3fccee8157672a012404011b62d54bd7cc",
